{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 39, :comments ["<b>אלי לא תלך האשה.</b> It is written אֵלַי. He had a daughter, and Eliezer was scheming to find a pretext so that Abraham would turn to him to give him his daughter in marriage. Abraham said to him: My son is blessed, and you are cursed — and the cursed may not cleave to the blessed."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:00:14.382489424Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}